{"answer_text":"Mobile apps vary a lot: some are full CRMs, others are read-only companions. The ones people rate highly on phones:\n\n### Top picks\n\n1. **Northwind CRM** — powerful and well supported, though per-seat costs climb quickly past the starter tier.\n2. **Kestrel CRM** — promising and free to start, though the integration list is still short.\n3. **Pipewell Go** — easy to adopt, but email features cost extra.\n\n**Bottom line:** Trial Northwind CRM and Kestrel CRM side by side with a real week of deals — the better fit is usually obvious by Friday.\n\nLedgerline's 2026 roundup ranks most of these near the top as well.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50b9-7430-b423-e258d8f991e1","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0109,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:00:39.550Z","engine":"chatgpt","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["crm app reviews ios android","simple crm mobile offline"],"latency_ms":6800,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a2eb448ab7","market_name":"Canada","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[137,150],[428,441]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-5864-7406-ad9e-7a386e391e3e","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"llm","name":"Kestrel CRM","name_text":"Kestrel CRM","offsets":[[248,259]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889b1141e640","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"alias","name":"Pipewell","name_text":"Pipewell","offsets":[[342,350]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment